  "description": "The Gold Bar XL Prefilled Pod Kit offers a convenient way to enjoy your favourite Gold Bar flavours in a compact, rechargeable device that delivers consistent flavour and smooth, satisfying performance. Designed for simplicity and sustainability, the Gold Bar XL uses a built-in 1200mAh battery and closed-pod format to provide a reliable mouth-to-lung (MTL) vaping experience with minimal upkeep. Each kit includes a 2ml prefilled pod that draws e-liquid from an attached 10ml refill reservoir. This integrated design allows the pod to be topped up multiple times from the connected chamber, extending its lifespan while remaining fully TPD-compliant. When the pod and refill are depleted, simply replace the unit with a fresh Gold Bar XL Refill Pods in your preferred flavour. The device is inhale-activated and features a built-in mesh coil for smooth vapour and steady flavour from the first puff to the last. Gold Bar XL Kit Flavours Apple Peach Crisp apple with a juicy peach finish Banana Ice A mellow banana profile with a cool, refreshing lift Berry Blast Mixed berries bursting with jammy depth and subtle tartness Blue Raspberry Bright and tangy with the unmistakeable edge of blue raspberry Blueberry Sour Raspberry A punchy fusion of sweet blueberry and tangy sour raspberry Cherry Fizz Red cherry with a fizzy twist that captures a sweet, soda-style spark Cola Freeze Cola soda with a cool icy finish Hawaiian Sunrise A juicy tropical blend of pineapple, peach and watermelon Lemon Lime A lively citrus mix of zesty lemon and fresh lime Oasis Lush watermelon, apple and strawberry in a smooth fruit medley Pineapple Ice Juicy pineapple with a brisk Ice streak for a cooler tropical hit Raspberry Watermelon Juicy watermelon blended with vibrant raspberry fruitiness Spearmint Light and sweet with a clean spearmint chill Summer Berries A fresh-tasting medley of ripe berry notes Watermelon Ice Sweet, sun-ripened watermelon layered with cool menthol Shop Gold Bar XL Refill Pods",
